--- !yfi/header
version: 1
namespace: tier5
visibility: public
mutability: mutable
--- !node &Alpha
pub p: 1
--- !node &Beta
pub p: 2
# An edge that declares nothing itself.
--- !edge &Rel
pub label: plain
# Its endpoints arrive by an extended reference: `X` installs `own(X)` onto
# `Rel`, so `Rel` reads a `connections` it never wrote. Reach-ness therefore
# has to follow the tier-5 edge in the *reverse* direction too.
--- !node &X
extends: !ref Rel
pub connections: [Alpha, Beta]
